t, music, food, sexual intimacy, and scientific insight, and credited one particular insight obtained under its influence with having been the direct inspiration for a published academic paper. The identity of 'Mr. X' was kept secret throughout the author's lifetime, and was revealed by Grinspoon only in 1999, three years after the author's death from myelodysplasia at the age of 62. ID ‘Mr. X’ who apart from his many other accomplishments also wrote the 1985 novel that was later adapted into Contact (1997) starring Jodie Foster as a radio astronomer searching for extraterrestrial intelligence.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T18:06:54Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Sagan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T18:06:57Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "sagan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T18:07:06Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Carl Sagan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T18:07:16Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Carl Sagan is correct!", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T18:07:38Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "total lurn that Sagan was into the good stuff", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T18:07:40Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Scores: Vats 20, Pavan 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T18:08:19Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Next one:", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]